Ang pinakamagandang approach ay huwag gawing Full Access / Restricted lang ang permission system.
Gawin nating granular:
No Access – hindi visible at walang access.
View Only – visible pero read-only.
Create Only – puwedeng gumawa pero hindi puwedeng mag-edit ng ibang records.
Create + Edit – puwedeng gumawa at mag-edit ng eligible records.
Process Access – puwedeng mag-submit at mag-process.
Review Access – puwedeng mag-review at mag-return.
Approval Access – puwedeng mag-approve subject to SoD and limits.
Full Authorized Access – lahat ng applicable actions, subject pa rin sa system security.
At higit sa lahat, ang bawat permission ay dapat puwedeng i-customize individually sa Role Permissions Catalog.